      "The release gate for Analyze Contractor Extension Decision Lag requires a reproducible case-flow table, locked denominator, source inventory, missing-evidence report, disagreement summary, sensitivity results, access review, retention decision, and owner-approved interpretation boundary. A complete-looking status column cannot substitute for these controls.",
